# Liam's own outro, once his elements phase decides the fight (LiamScript.OUTRO_DIALOGUE). LiamOutro.dialogue stays with
# Bixby: its player_lost still covers losing to him. player_won: the player beat Liam himself. player_lost: either phase
# after the hand-over beat the player.

~ player_won
Liam: Fine. You win, newcomer. Jordan's waiting for you. [#liam=beaten]
=> END

~ player_lost
Liam: Nyahahaha! [#liam=laugh, #blips=off]
=> END
